Section 3: Phishing and More
Someone reported a phishing email from the sender gaara@qq.com. You pull up the emails and notice the links inside look suspicious. How many domains were observed in the links from these emails?
Email
| where sender == "gaara@qq.com"
| extend domain = tostring(parse_url(link).Host)
| distinct domain
Answer: 4

Which one of these domains was used the least?
let links=
Email
| where sender == "gaara@qq.com"
| distinct link;
OutboundBrowsing
| where url in (links)
| summarize count() by url
Answer: clan.io

What was the subject line of the emails containing the domain clan.io?
Email
| where link contains "clan.io"
| project subject
Answer: 50% discount on Naruto anime this weekend

What is the name of the user who clicked on the clan.io link?
let phished_ip=
OutboundBrowsing
| where url contains "clan.io"
| project src_ip;
Employees
| where ip_addr in (phished_ip)
| project name
Answer: Erica Wilson

What actor IP was used to compromise the account of this user?
let phished_ip=
OutboundBrowsing
| where url contains "clan.io"
| project src_ip;
let phished_username=
Employees
| where ip_addr in (phished_ip)
| project username;
AuthenticationEvents
| where username in (phished_username)
| project src_ip
Answer: 223.80.243.56

How many accounts did the actor compromise using the IP identified earlier?
AuthenticationEvents
| where src_ip == "223.80.243.56"
| where result contains "success"
| distinct username
Answer: 8

What .info domain shared IPs with domain clan.io?
let bad_ip=
PassiveDns
| where domain == "clan.io"
| project ip;
PassiveDns
| where ip in (bad_ip)
| where domain contains ".info"
| project domain
Answer: arbiters-tail.info

Which password (hash) was used in failed login attempts against 40 unique accounts?
let internal_ip=
Employees
| project ip_addr;
let comp_users=
AuthenticationEvents
| where result contains "Failed"
| where src_ip !in (internal_ip)
| distinct username;
AuthenticationEvents
| where username in (comp_users)
| summarize dcount(username) by password_hash
Answer: 1a594fcb-ac60-6f03-bea6-39dd3fdba026

The login activity exhibited by the user agent above is an example of this attack (2 words)?
Answer: password spray

We can pivot off of the IPs we can find by looking at the PassiveDNS results associated with the domain swindled.bio. Looking at their web requests, what terms are they looking for on the company website?
